  "description": "FruityWiFi is a wireless network auditing tool. The application can be installed in any Debian based system (Jessie) adding the extra packages. Tested in Debian, Kali Linux, Kali Linux ARM (Raspberry Pi), Raspbian (Raspberry Pi), Pwnpi (Raspberry Pi), Bugtraq, NetHunter.",
  "description_ja": "FruityWiFi は無線ネットワーク監査ツール。Debian 系システム（Jessie）に追加パッケージを導入することでインストール可能。Debian、Kali Linux、Kali Linux ARM（Raspberry Pi）、Raspbian（Raspberry Pi）、Pwnpi（Raspberry Pi）、Bugtraq、NetHunter で動作確認済み。",
